## 344. Reverse String

## Approach:
--  I used two pointers, one starting from the beginning and the other from the end of the array. 
--  I swapped the elements at both pointers and moved them towards the center until the string was reversed.

## Complexity:
Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)

SOLUTION : 
class Solution {
    public void reverseString(char[] s) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = s.length-1;
        while (left < right) {
            char temp = s[left];
            s[left] = s[right];
            s[right] = temp;

            left++;
            right--;
        }
    }
}
